(******************************************************************************)
(* Probe T0: one named Tableau Sampled value continued twice                  *)
(*                                                                            *)
(* A row is one security claim with its whole chain, so two claims about one  *)
(* probability model are two programs over one model. That shape needs a      *)
(* Tableau Sampled value to be namable and continuable twice, and no program  *)
(* of the tree branches at Sampled today. This file names the five-card       *)
(* uniform model as such a value and runs two certify continuations from it.  *)
(* Both continuations certify the exact arm with one witness, so what is      *)
(* published twice is one security claim under two pairs of statuses; what    *)
(* the pair exhibits is the branch point itself, whose payload type reduces   *)
(* through the name.                                                          *)
(*                                                                            *)
(* The hazard the design audit records is that a continuation's payload type  *)
(* is ExactPayload (tableau_at X) for the named X, so sp_f must reduce        *)
(* through the name X before the instance's witness can unify with it.        *)
(*                                                                            *)
(* Definitions:                                                               *)
(*   five_card_uniform_sampled                                                *)
(*                           == the five-card uniform model, named at Sampled *)
(*                              and continued twice                           *)
(*   five_card_row_uniform_branch                                             *)
(*                           == the first continuation, published             *)
(*   five_card_row_uniform_branch_ideal                                       *)
(*                           == the second, published at another status       *)
(*   s5_rand_sampled         == another instance's model, named at Sampled    *)
(*                                                                            *)
(* Key results:                                                               *)
(*   five_card_row_uniform_branch_rowE                                        *)
(*                           == the branch publishes the manifest's own       *)
(*                              uniform row                                   *)
(*   five_card_row_uniform_branch_atE                                         *)
(*                           == the first continuation and the unbranched     *)
(*                              program hold one AnalysisBridged coordinate   *)
(*   five_card_row_uniform_branch_ideal_atE                                   *)
(*                           == the second continuation holds that same       *)
(*                              coordinate                                    *)
(******************************************************************************)

